Third party components used by this sample
==========================================

None of these components is included in this repository. They are installed
separately and are subject to their own licenses. None of them is GPL licensed.

Python packages (requirements.txt, for the tools and scripts; the Lambda function
uses the boto3 of the AWS Lambda Python 3.12 runtime and bundles nothing)

- boto3 - Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/boto/boto3
- botocore - Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/boto/botocore
- s3transfer - Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/boto/s3transfer
- jmespath - MIT - https://github.com/jmespath/jmespath.py
- python-dateutil - Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause - https://github.com/dateutil/dateutil
- six - MIT - https://github.com/benjaminp/six
- urllib3 - MIT - https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3
- PyYAML - MIT - https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml

Packages the optional test SMTP host (templates/test-smtp.yaml) installs from the
Amazon Linux 2023 repositories at deploy time

- Postfix - IPL-1.0 OR EPL-2.0 - https://www.postfix.org/
- Cyrus SASL - BSD-style (CMU) - https://github.com/cyrusimap/cyrus-sasl
- OpenSSL - Apache-2.0 - https://www.openssl.org/
- Python 3 - PSF-2.0 - https://www.python.org/
- boto3 (python3-boto3, only with DeliveryMode=ses) - Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/boto/boto3
